  "question": {
    "text": "Smallest division on the main scale of given Vernier calipers is <math><mn>0.5</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>m</mn><mn>m</mn></math> . Vernier scale has <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn></math> divisions and these coincide with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>24</mn></math> main scale divisions. The least count of Vernier callipers is"
